# Vibe Guard — Cursor Project Rules

## Project Context
Vibe Guard is an AI-powered secure code auditor for AI-generated/AI-assisted applications.

For Review 1, build ONLY the React frontend prototype. Demonstrate:
Upload Code → Static Scanner → Vulnerability Detection → AI Analysis → Recommended Fix → Security Report

Use mock/static data only. Do not implement FastAPI, Semgrep, Bandit, database, authentication, real AI APIs, Docker, AWS, or source-code execution yet.

## Design
- Dark modern cybersecurity SaaS dashboard
- Professional, minimal, polished
- Strong information hierarchy and spacing
- Subtle borders/depth
- Severity indicators: critical/high/medium/low
- Monospace code viewer
- Avoid excessive neon, gaming aesthetics, huge gradients, or generic chatbot styling

## Navigation
Persistent sidebar:
- Vibe Guard
- Dashboard
- New Scan
- Reports
- Scan History
- Settings

Bottom: Review 1 Prototype / Version 0.1

