Layout, Sidebar, Topbar, StatCard, SecurityScore, SeverityBadge, VulnerabilityCard, VulnerabilityList, CodeViewer, CodeComparison, AIRecommendation, ScanPipeline, UploadZone, ProgressIndicator, ReportSummary.

## Demo Flow
