## Rules for Cursor
1. Preserve the existing design system.
2. Prefer reusable components.
3. Keep mock data centralized.
4. Keep routes predictable.
5. Maintain Review 1 frontend-only scope.
6. Do not add backend/API functionality unless explicitly requested.
7. Do not execute uploaded source code.
8. Avoid unnecessary dependencies.
9. Reuse existing components before creating new patterns.
10. Keep every screen presentation-ready.
